In this paper we focus, for a given word, on the sets of scattered factors of a given length: the (full) *k*-spectrum of *w* is the set containing all scattered factors of *w* of length exactly *k* (up to *k* resp.). The total set of scattered factors (also called downward closure) of $\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
